<p>Fractions and roots:</p>
<pre class="math problematic">
\frac{1}{1+\frac{1}{x}} \quad \dfrac{a}{b} \quad \tfrac{a}{b}
\quad \cfrac[l]{a}{b} \quad \nicefrac{1}{2} \quad \sqrt{x}
\quad \sqrt[n]{1+x}
</pre>
<aside class="system-message">
<p class="system-message-title">System Message: WARNING/2 (<span class="docutils literal">testdata/fixtures/math_html_constructs.rst</span>, line 15)</p>
<p>Unknown LaTeX command &quot;\nicefrac&quot;.</p>
</aside>
<p>Big operators with limits:</p>
<div>
<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
  <munderover>
    <mo movablelimits="true">∑</mo>
    <mrow>
      <mi>i</mi>
      <mo>=</mo>
      <mn>1</mn>
    </mrow>
    <mi>n</mi>
  </munderover>
  <mi>i</mi>
  <mspace width="1em"></mspace>
  <munder>
    <mo movablelimits="true">∏</mo>
    <mi>k</mi>
  </munder>
  <msub>
    <mi>a</mi>
    <mi>k</mi>
  </msub>
  <mspace width="1em"></mspace>
  <msubsup>
    <mo>∫</mo>
    <mn>0</mn>
    <mn>1</mn>
  </msubsup>
  <mi>f</mi>
  <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
  <mi>x</mi>
  <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
  <mspace width="0.1667em"></mspace>
  <mi>d</mi>
  <mi>x</mi>
  <mspace width="1em"></mspace>
  <munder>
    <mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo>
    <mi>i</mi>
  </munder>
  <mspace width="1em"></mspace>
  <msubsup>
    <mo>∫</mo>
    <mi>a</mi>
    <mi>b</mi>
  </msubsup>
  <mspace width="1em"></mspace>
  <munder>
    <mo movablelimits="true">lim</mo>
    <mrow>
      <mi>x</mi>
      <mo>→</mo>
      <mn>0</mn>
    </mrow>
  </munder>
  <mi>f</mi>
  <mspace width="1em"></mspace>
  <mover>
    <mo movablelimits="true">∑</mo>
    <mi>n</mi>
  </mover>
  <mspace width="1em"></mspace>
  <munder>
    <mo movablelimits="true">max</mo>
    <mi>i</mi>
  </munder>
  <msub>
    <mi>x</mi>
    <mi>i</mi>
  </msub>
</math>
</div>
<p>Delimiters:</p>
<pre class="math problematic">
\left( \frac{a}{b} \right) \left[ x \right] \left\{ y \right\}
\left. \frac{a}{b} \right|_0
\left\langle a \middle| b \right\rangle
\left( \frac{\frac{a}{b}}{c} \right)
\bigl( \Bigl( \biggl( x \biggr) \Bigr) \bigr)
</pre>
